<title>PAKISTAN: HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE RESULT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on the second day of the</p>
<p>Golden Jubilee of Pakistan men's hockey tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Germany beat England 2-0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Christoph Bechmann 14, 57</p>
</text>
